# Design review loop (Flutter)

When improving UI or completing a screen redesign:

1. Read [DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md) and [design-review/RUBRIC.md](../../design-review/RUBRIC.md).
2. Capture the target state:
   - `npm run capture:design-review -- --only {screenId}`
   - Or open `http://localhost:8080/?design_review={screenId}__{state}`
3. Score /10 using RUBRIC. **Pass only if ≥ 9 and no critical violations.**
4. Feedback format:
   - Score table (each RUBRIC category)
   - Critical / High / Medium issues with file paths
   - Concrete fix tied to DESIGN.md tokens
5. Apply fixes in Flutter (`app_design_system.dart`, screen/widgets).
6. Re-capture the same state; repeat until pass.
7. Update [design-review/PROGRESS.md](../../design-review/PROGRESS.md) when a state reaches `done`.

