## Auto-fail patterns

- Emoji as list/status icons
- Material `ChoiceChip` black outlines (use custom pills)
- Play icon on every tappable row + row tap (duplicate CTA)
- Progress hidden at 0%
- Dark scaffold, violet `#7C6FF7`, heavy shadows

## P0 order

student_hub → upload → analysis → practice → student_progress
